## ObjectType: Order Item

Line item connecting an order and a product.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| item_id | Item ID | string | Unique line identifier | item_id |
| order_id | Order ID | string | Parent order | order_id |
| product_id | Product ID | string | Purchased product | product_id |
| quantity | Quantity | integer | Purchased units | quantity |
| unit_price | Unit Price | decimal | Agreed unit price | unit_price |

### Keys

Primary Keys: item_id
Display Key: item_id

### Data Source

| Type | ID | Name |
| --- | --- | --- |
| resource | order_items_csv | order_items.csv |
